<ol start="27">
<li><strong> PROJECT DELAY</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Late Delivery and Penalty. In case of delayed delivery except for Force Majeure cases, the service provider shall pay to the Agency for every 1 Month of delay penalty amounting to 3% of the total value of the Project whose delivery has been delayed.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Any fractional part of a week is to be considered a full week. The total amount of penalty shall not however, exceed 40% of the total value of the Service involved in late delivery. If the delay is more than 10 weeks, the client is entitled to terminate this Contract.</p>
